.TH SDIOResetCounter 2type 2026-08-14 "Linux"

.SH NAME
SDIOResetCounter \- piControl driver struct for resetting counters and encoders

.SH LIBRARY
piControl device driver ioctl interface

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B "#include <piControl.h>"
.sp
.B typedef struct SDIOResetCounterStr {
.BR "    __u8   i8uAddress;" "    /* address of module in current configuration */"
.BR "    __u8   pad;" "           /* padding */"
.BR "    __u16  i16uBitfield;" "  /* bitfield for resetting counter/encoder */"
.B } SDIOResetCounter;
.fi

.SH DESCRIPTION
Contains information about which counters and encoders to reset for an
expansion module.

The fields are as follows:

.TP
.I i8uAddress
This field contains the address of the expansion module on the piBridge bus.
.TP
.I pad
This field is padding and must be zeroed.
.TP
.I i16uBitfield
This field contains a bitmask of the counters and encoders that should be
considered.

.SH SEE ALSO

.BR ioctl (2),
.BR KB_DIO_RESET_COUNTER (2)
